SUMMARY:Stand-Up Showcase
LOCATION:Washington
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy great stand-up comedy in downtown DC. Our showcase lineup
 s feature top talent from DC\, Maryland\, Virginia and beyond\, performing 
 on one of the country's most famous stages. You'll see a variety of styles 
 and get up close with some of the stars of tomorrow. Support local talent\,
  support local business and (most important) laugh your a** off. Showcases 
 generally last around 90 minutes.\n\nAugust 28-30 lineup: Dale Dunlap\, Ray
  Diva\, Matt Brown\, Stacey Axler\, Dom Grayer\n\nSeptember 5-6 lineup: Tre
  Solomon\, Jenny Questell\, Ross Benoit\, Chanel Ali\, Mike Kurtz\n\nSeptem
 ber 18-20 lineup: David Balagizi\, Tim Smith\, Joey Friedman\, Chris Coccia
 \, Apple Brown Betty\n\nAll sales are final. Refunds and exchanges are offe
 red only when a show is canceled or rescheduled.\n\nAdmission Policies\n\nP
 atrons must be 18 or older to attend events or classes at the DC Improv. An
 y exceptions are clearly noted in the event descriptions.\n\nThere is a two
 -item minimum per customer. This can be any combination of food items or be
 verages. Bottled water and soft drinks count as items. (The two-item minimu
 m does not apply to comedy classes.)\n\nCoupons or passes for free admissio
 n cannot be used for a show listed as a "special event."\n\nSeating Policie
 s\n\nAll shows in our lounge showroom are seated by time of arrival. The ea
 rlier you arrive\, the more options you'll have. Please note that the size 
 of your party can affect what options are available to you\, as certain tab
 les and areas are designated for larger parties.\n\nFor general admission t
 ickets\, if your party does not fill an entire table\, you may be sharing a
  table with other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas
 /event/stand-up-showcase-31024/
